Build a table from these rows, with the first row as the header:

    name  team  score
    ann   red   10
    bo    blue  20
    cy    red   30
    di    blue  40

Print three lines, in this order:

1. the mean of the score column
2. the total score of the red team
3. how many rows have a score above 15

Print each with `.` followed by `cr`, so each line holds one number.
